            {
                "box": {
                    "id": "obj-83",
                    "linecount": 107,
                    "maxclass": "comment",
                    "numinlets": 1,
                    "numoutlets": 0,
                    "patching_rect": [ 19.0, 82.0, 244.80000364780426, 1547.0 ],
                    "text": "the sendbind abstraction sends out parameter values to be displayed in the UI.\n\nmany s/r objs use symbols with spaces as names. rnbo doesn't support symbols with spaces in replaceable args. todo: replace spaces with underscores in all binding s/r objs, and move `s #1` into sendbind abstraction\n\n* 1. Main Stutter Enable (uni)\n2. Main Stutter Accel (bi)\n3. Main Stutter Autopan (uni)\n4. Main Stutter Reverse (uni)\n* 5. solo Stutter Enable (uni)\n6. solo Stutter Accel (bi)\n7. solo Stutter Autopan (uni)\n8. solo Stutter Reverse (uni)\n9. drum Stutter Enable (uni)\n10. drum Stutter Accel (bi)\n11. drum Stutter Autopan (uni)\n12. drum Stutter Reverse (uni)\n13. looper Stutter Enable (uni)\n14. looper Stutter Accel (bi)\n15. looper Stutter Autopan (uni)\n16. looper Stutter Reverse (uni)\n17. looper scatter enable (uni)\n18. Main Delay Send 1 (uni)\n19. Main Delay Fdbk 1 (uni)\n20. Main Delay Fdbk amt held\n21. Main Delay Freq 1 (bi)\n22. Main Delay Out Vol\n23. looper Delay Send 1 (uni)\n24. looper Delay Fdbk 1 (uni)\n25. looper Delay Fdbk amt held\n26. looper Delay Freq 1 (bi)\n27. looper Delay Out Vol\n28. solo Delay Send 1 (uni)\n29. solo Delay Fdbk 1 (uni)\n30. solo Delay Fdbk amt held\n31. solo Delay Freq 1 (bi)\n32. solo Delay Out Vol\n33. drum Delay Send 1 (uni)\n34. drum Delay Fdbk 1 (uni)\n35. drum Delay Fdbk amt held\n36. drum Delay Freq 1 (bi)\n37. drum Delay Out Vol\n38. Envelope Crossfade Position (bi)\n39. enable envelope crossfade\n40. enable transient helper\n41. pitchshift_transpose\n42. LFO shape (bi)\n43. LFO Main Speed (bi)\n44. LFO Floor Envelope Sensitivity\n45. LFO Ceiling Envelope Sensitivity\n46. LFO pow (bi)\n47. LPF resonance\n48. Swing Amount\n49. auto-wah enable\n50. auto-wah adjust\n51. ADSR enable\n52. toggle bumper drumming\n53. bumper drumming enabled\n54. randomize_drumkit\n55. trigger_tom\n56. trigger_clap\n57. trigger_snare\n58. trigger_kick\n59. drum_groove_rate\n60. tap_tempo\n61. toggle_metronome\n62. set_time_sig_numerator\n63. kickduck_status\n64. main_looper_length_bars\n65. drum_looper_length_bars\n66. Main Reverb Send (uni)\n67. Looper Reverb Send (uni)\n68. Drum Reverb Send (uni)\n69. main_looper_button\n70. drum_looper_button\n71. looper_filtersweep\n72. drum_filtersweep\n73. RV_post-deadzone\n74. RH_post-deadzone\n75. LV_post-deadzone\n76. LH_post-deadzone\n77. main subdiv\n78. subdiv phase reset\n79. talkback_enable\n80. tri-square xfade\n81. LFO Free Speed (bi)\n82. LFO Sync-Free Crossfade (uni)\n83. Octaver Enable\n84. autoswing_enable\n85. crossfade_mode\n86. \"lpf freq mod mode\"\n87. crossfade binding mode\n88. tremomo depth\n89. tremolo duty\n90. tremolo accel\n91. tremolo autopan\n92. idle enable\n\ninto thispatcher to auto-create 70+ objs:\nsprintf script newobject newobj \\\\@text \\\"p @file sendbind @args \\\\\\\"%s\\\\\\\" %i\\\" \\\\@fixwidth 1"
                }
            },
